tess (0.7.0~alpha.16-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add taskbar progress tracking.
  * Add ability to print the settings location.
  * Improve PTY read loop and performance by reducing flow-control overhead.
  * Prevent a race condition when launching a new PTY.
  * Fix incorrect title after closing the active tab.
  * Hide details card while dragging tabs.
  * Prevent opening the GTK emoji chooser.

 -- Clément FOURÉ <clement.foure@proton.me>  Fri, 17 Apr 2026 20:05:33 +0000

tess (0.7.0~alpha.15-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add details card on tab hover.
  * Support multi-line highlighting for hyperlinks.
  * Handle quotes and environment variables when parsing the profile command.
  * Add focus_mode and details_card_delay fields to app_behavior settings.
  * Add minimum_contrast_ratio field to terminal settings.
  * Add intercept_signals field to desktop_integration settings.
  * Move open_in_tab field from desktop_integration to app_behavior settings.
  * Rename tab field to process in close_confirmation settings.
  * Prevent losing focus when clicking the titlebar.
  * Display "Untitled" as the default widget title.

 -- Clément FOURÉ <clement.foure@proton.me>  Tue, 20 Jan 2026 21:09:49 +0000

tess (0.7.0~alpha.14-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add hyperlink support as well as detection of http and https URLs.
  * Define $COLORTERM, $TERM_PROGRAM and $TERM_PROGRAM_VERSION for
    compatibility.
  * Add the ability to define an initial shell title.
  * Rename 'MAJ' to 'SHIFT' in shortcuts for consistency.

 -- Clément FOURÉ <clement.foure@proton.me>  Thu, 12 Jun 2025 17:47:27 +0000

